ch of the selected steps.\n\n- We first consider line $\\text{L1},$ which states that\n\n$$\nf=O\\,(\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+1}),\n$$\n\nand this is true by $\\text{the reflexive property}.$\n\n- Next, we consider line $\\text{L3}.$ From line $\\text{L1},$ we have\n\n$$\nf=O\\,(\\frac{1}{x}+\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+1})\n$$\n\nand from line $\\text{L2},$ we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{x}{{x}^{2}+1}=O\\,(\\frac{1}{x}).\n$$\n\nThus, by lines $\\text{L1 and L2}$ and the $\\text{absorption property},$ we have \n\n$$\nf=O\\,(\\frac{1}{x}).\n$$\n\n- Finally, we consider line $\\text{L5}.$ From line $\\text{L3}$ we have\n\n$$\nf=O\\,(\\frac{1}{x}),\n$$\n\nand from line $\\text{L4}$ we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{x}=O(1).\n$$\n\nThus, by lines   $\\text{L3 and L4}$ and $\\text{the transitive property},$ we obtain\n\n$$\nf=O(1).\n$$" 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1000 #edb/ref 17592186311987 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1000 #edb/ref 17592186311988 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1000 #edb/ref 17592186311989 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1000 #edb/ref 17592186311990 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1000 #edb/ref 17592186311991 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045451 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1041 "field-1" 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1104 #edb/ref 17592186311991 13194139534816 true] [17592186311986 1110 #uuid "3b5fbd66-8af9-5f84-86c7-a1de13121f77" 13194139534816 true] [17592186311987 1034 "the absorption property" 13194139534816 true] [17592186311987 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534816 true] [17592186311987 1111 #uuid "9080b2de-975c-5841-b631-d40d97ed4671" 13194139534816 true] [17592186311988 1034 "the constant multiple property" 13194139534816 true] [17592186311988 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139534816 true] [17592186311988 1111 #uuid "a1a5cff2-d42b-5013-9907-c6996d0c2163" 13194139534816 true] [17592186311989 1034 "the sum property" 13194139534816 true] [17592186311989 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 131